<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">- Alago Bible Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">1 Otesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc1">Okpa ko Obulus kikyikyo da Ase ko Otesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 oTasoloniyawa</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Ote</para>
  <para style="mt2">Okpa ko Obulus kikyikyo da</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ase ko Otesalonika</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="s">Ogbogba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />Ami Obulus kpo Osila kpo Otimoti tenena mani dala ase ko Otesalonika, ipu ki iye ko Owuso Ada kpa Adole Oyesu Okristi: oneshi kpo omene na yo kpa ala.<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Olayi kpo otuse kase ko Otesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />Aba shotunehe do Owuso ikweyi kala kpiri, aba rela kala ipu ki inarigwu kaha. <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />Aba rela kala obutu ko Owuso Ada ko oko ni ala ya kpo otuse kala ni, kpi imu kala ni yala yoko kotata ni, kpi iyitagye kala ipu ka Adole Oyesu Okristi ni loshu ni. <verse eid="1TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />Ayene hin, agye mo Owuso ya yimu kala anu ki shala wa akaka nu. <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />Ikweyi koni abyo oshu neshi webe kala byela kin lalo ke wa kpo oshu, kpo Omaku ko Owuso kpo oshu ko kwokwoshi, ala rela kishi ni aha bagye dudu ni; owa ko neshi kala. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />Ala ba gbaha kpa Adole, koni ala ba mowe ni, ala zela ko Owuso kpo otunehe na dala bwebe ko Omaku ko Owuso. <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />Ni olemani, ala ba woza ko gbogba dawo ko Owuso ni gbotuse kpiri Omakidoniya kpo Akaya. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Ela kotuse kala ebe ko Owuso bwebe kala gebe kase ebebe nya. Oki gohobu ko ogya ko Omakidoniya kpo Akaya, oke kweyi ebeni lo, oge ebebenya kpiri aba kela ko otuse kala daha ipu ko Owuso. Ashu ko kojije dawa ikweyi nu ke lo. <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />Koni kpiri wa kedo ko omaba ni ala yaha ni. Kpo owe ni ala bwu gbishini ala she eka yoya bita webe ko Owuso, kweyi geyagye do Owuso ni wo kwokwoshi kpo olayi ni, <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />kweyi gbabo ko Oyi nu bwi Iso. Oyi nu Oyesu ni oshiyi bwa amiri ni, anu ni ya ngmaha bwa anya ko Owuso ni yawa ni.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Obulus Yoko Otesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Ayene ka, ala abiyikala gye mo owowa ni awa mala ni wo yeye la lo. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />Ala gyedo ko owe kpi iweyi ni ama ogya ko Ofilipi imbe awebe kala Otesalonika ni. Koni atasaha eyi ni, Owuso taha otugbagba shan kyoleho koshu neshi ni bwebe nu ni. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Oboba ni aba bala mani wogu bibi lalo, kwe agbotu bibi ikweyi kala kwe ko gyala egya la lo. <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />Aha ke ba kela ni Owuso kyogwu mo ahan ka, koni Owuso maha shu kweyi odaha oshu neshi nu. Aha ba yimu ko shasuse otu lalo, Owuso pini aba yimu ko shotu la, anu ni ya motu kaha ma ni. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Ala gye maha ba yo okwunu lonye lo, ake ba kela ko yo ofa yoya kaha gwu lalo. Owuso pini wo olobene kaha la! <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />Aha ba yimu shashishe naka kaha lo, kala, kase ashini, <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />koni awayikoko ko Okristi ni agboshu ko dala oka koza shishini. Aha ke byala neshi ishini abagye kpa ala ni, bye ene ya bya ayinu ni. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />Ikweyi ki imu ni aha gbo dala sheyigagye ni yaha zolayi kaha kpo oshu neshi ko Owuso dala, koni aha yimu kala kotata ni! <verse eid="1TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Ayene hin, kokwokwoshi ala rela ko oko kpo owe ni aha ma kotata ni! Aha yoko ko otu ke eno shini ahan ka wegye dala ishini aba dala oshu neshi ni bwebe ko Owuso ni. <verse eid="1TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Ala wo olobene ka byoni Owuso we ni. Obagye kaha kpa ala ase ni kyogwu kpo Owuso ni, wo sere, kpo oneshi, agbotu bibi ipu kaha lo. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />Ala gye mo aya kpa ala byoni awada kpa awene baya kpa ayi wa ni, <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />aha tala otugbagba kweyi shinyi shosha shala otu aki bala mala yoza owe ni ya sho Owuso otu ni, anu ni yala ogwu ipu ko obula kpi igyashi nu ni. <verse eid="1TH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Oza ni ya ni aba shotunehe do Owuso kurutu ikweyi koni, ishini ala zela ko Owuso, na ala pwo bwe ebe kaha ni, ala kyogwu kpa anu byela ka asuse la lo, ke wela ko Owuso la, ni ya yoko ipu kala ni kyogwu ni. <verse eid="1TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />Ayene, oza ni gbodagye kpa ala mani gbodagye kpo oda ka awogboso Owuso okpagye ko Oyahuda ni bipu ko Okristi Oyesu. Ala ba megye abo kase kala, byoni awa ma abo kase ko Oyahuda ni. <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />Ase ko Oyahuda pini ya Adole Oyesu kpa awobane yi ngmo la, aki daha egye. Owuso yanya kpa awa kotata! Awo omonyekwotu kananoho! <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />Atakirikwu ko wahobi ko tono dase ni wo Oyahuda lo ni shini ana ka ngma awa lo. Mani oni akpo ozalabi wa tukpa ikweyi wa. Ogwejeji anya ko Owuso sa ikweyi wa.<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obulus Yimu ko Kyi Ga Muwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Ayene, ishini ashala bita kishi gbayayi ni, ikpiye pini shala bita la ke wo otu kaha la lo. Aba rela kala kotata, kweyi ayiyitagye mo aki bawa mala ba. <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />Agbi imu ko webe kala. Ami Obulus ya takirikwu ko wa igbo oye kin lo, Ibiri ke kyahagwu lo. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Oji wi iyitagye kaha, ala lalo? Ala pini wo otunehe kaha la, ala pini yaha ba gwakya maha ba rogwa obutu ka Adole Oyesu eno ko wowa nu la. <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Kokwokwoshi ala pini yaha ba gwakya kyi ba shotunehe la.<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />Ogwejeji, agege ko zotu kelo, akwikye ga bagye fufukaha ogya ka Atenas <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />Otimoti ni wo oyene kaha ni aba yoko ko Owuso dudu ko koshu neshi ko Okristi ni, atoleho shini na dala oshu naki talotugbagba ipu ko otuse kala, <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />shini owe mani na ka ya ashishe na kwikye itikpi lo. Ala abiyikala gye neneshi mo owe naha bama mani woyoya ko Owuso la. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Koni ishini aha tayoyo baba kpa ala ni, akwobonu ka dala mo aba wa daha egye. Oke wa gbodagye mani, byoni ala gye ni. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Ni olemani oni, nggege ko zotu ke lo, nto Otimoti oleho shini na gyo hagye loshu ko otuse kala. Nyya yoshi mo Ibiri wa gyalegya kweyi yoko kaha woyeye wa! <verse eid="1TH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Ishini Otimoti ke kwikye bwebe kala wa ni, owa daha oshu neshi ikweyi ko otuse kpi imu kala. Oki ka daha mo ala ba rela kaha kpo oneshi kurutu, ki gbimu ko maha byoni aha gbimu ko mala ni. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />Ni olemani oni, ayene ipu ko owe kaha kpe egye kaha apyoshu ipu kotu kaha ikweyi ko otuse kala. <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />Koni anani agye mo aba shala bita, ikweyi koni ala hagye loshu ipu ka Adole. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Anani aba shotunehe do Owuso ikweyi kala. Aba shotunehe ko otushosha ni agbo obutu ko Owuso ikweyi kala ni. <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />Kotu ke eno aba tinarigwu da Adole ko ki gyiyi kpa ala shan dala oza ni ala ba doka ipu ko otuse. <verse eid="1TH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Owuso Ada kaha abiyinu kpa Adole Oyesu na kyowe tu daha ko we ebe kala. <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Adole na yala shini ala gohobu ko yimu kiyi kala kotata kweyi kyi yimu ka ananoho, byoni aha ba gohobu ko yimu kala ni. <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />Ona talotugbagba shini ala ka gbepwo lo kyi wase sere obutu ko Owuso Ada kaha ishini Adole kaha Oyesu wa kpase sere nu kpiri.<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="s">Oyagye ni Sho Owuso Otu ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Ogwejeji, ayene ka, byoni aha fala ni, oyagye kala na sho Owuso otu, byoni ala kwobonu ba ya ni. Anani aba kadala, aki ba tala otugbagba ipu ka Adole Oyesu mo ala takirikwu shini ala ki ya she mani. <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Koni ala gyo oza ni aha fala bwebe ko oshu ka Adole Oyesu ni.<verse eid="1TH 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />Oza ni Owuso ya yimu ebe kala ni wo, ala wase sere kweyi ala ngmi iyikala she ebaboba. <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />Ananoho kala na kwiyinu ipu ko sere shini ase na mala gyiyi, <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />ala ka showu keba byoza ni Awase ni gyo Owuso lo baya ni lo. <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />Ikweyi kela mani, ashishe na ka yo oyinanu ozalabi kwe ona mowu nu lo. Byoni akwobonu ka dala ni kyi pyala akpaha ni, Adole ya gbawino yoza mani ogo agye. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Owuso yaha ogwu ko beba lalo, ke wa ko yawu ipu ko sere la.<verse eid="1TH 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Ni olemani oni, ase ni tela ko ozafofu mani, otela kasuse lalo, oke tela ko Owuso ni da aha Omaku nu sere ni la.<verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Ela kimu ka ayene ashu ko ta dala kelo ikweyi koni Owuso abiyinu fala owe ko yimu kiyikala. <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />Kokwokwoshi ala ba yimu ka ayene kpiri ni bo okpagye ko Omakidoniya ni. Aba tala otugbagba ayene sha ala gohobu ko ya mani.<verse eid="1TH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />Ala takirikwu sha ala bagye ko mene, ala yiyi kwo oza ni yo ohobu kala kin, kweyi yo oko kpa abo kala, byoni akwobonu ka dala ni, <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />bwebe koni awase ni gyo Owuso lo ni ba mala gyiyi, kweyi ala ba yotu sa ashishe ko pyoza ni ala ba yimu ni lo.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Owowa ka Adole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />Ayene, aba yimu sha ala gyo kwokwoshi ikweyi kawase ni gbola ni, shini ala ka byotu byawase ni gbotuse lo ni. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />Akyogwu mo Oyesu gekwu okyi nyiso akyi kyogwu mo bwebe ko Oyesu, Owuso ya shawa ase ni gbola mani iyi dudu kpo Oyesu. <verse eid="1TH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />Byoni Adole kani, aba ka dala mo, aha ni tayoyo biyi, ni shishini gbeno ko owowa ka Adole ni, aba kwobonu dawa ase ni gbola ni ko ga lo kpiri-kpiri. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />Koni Adole abiyinu ya sa bwi iso, ya zoko loshu loshu, kpo oko nyaku ko oyoleho, kpa ajigwo ko Owuso, awase ni gekwu ipu ko Okristi ni ba nyiso ikyikyo. <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />Itikpi koni, aha ni biyi ni, aba kpaha gbayi kpawa dudu ipu ka akpa, shini agbayi kpa Adole ipu ki iso. Aba bagye kpanu ko gbogbo-gbogbo.<verse eid="1TH 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Mani oni ala tiyi kala otugbagba kpe ela mani.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="s">Kyiyi ka tu Gbeyi ko wowa ka Adole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Nabani ayene, ela kishi kpe eno ashu ko ta dala ke lo ikweyi kawo oza ni bawa gbodagye ni, <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />koni ala gye mo eno ka Adole ya wa byowi yawa otu ni. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />Ishini ase ba ka mo, &lt;&lt;Aba bagye ko mene kpo otu shosha.&gt;&gt; Kweyi owe wa tawa wo gyogye wa lo, byoni ose koma ya lonya ni bifu ni, aki ba gbo owe ko bose lo.<verse eid="1TH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Ayene ala ke bipu kebe dibu lalo, eno mani naka wa tala byo owi wa tase ni lo. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />Kpiri ka ala wa ayi ko yoyu kpe eno la. Aha wako otu kwe ebe dibu lalo. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Ni olemani oni ahan ka gbola bya ashishini kase lo, akyiyi ka tu kweyi bagye kotu mene. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />Otu pini ase ba gbola la, otu pini ase ba yinyi la. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />Koni aha ke wa ke eno la, ahan gbiyi ka. Ahan shoshiye ko otuse kpi imu byo oshiye kogye kweyi iyitagye ka na ngmaha byo ozakeyi kogye.<verse eid="1TH 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Owuso shaha ko mo we ipu kanya nu lalo, ke wa ko ngmaha bwebe ka Adole Oyesu Okristi.<verse eid="1TH 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />Ogekwu ikweyi kaha, kwa abiyi kwa aba gbola, ishini owa ahan bagye dudu kpa anu.<verse eid="1TH 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Ni olemani oni ala tiyikala otugbagba, ala tiyikala abo byoni ala baya ni.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akpaha Pyopyi ko Gwejeji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Anani aba ba ala ayene, ala za abokpa da awase ni ba yo oko kpotu oye kponu ipu kala, ni wa anyakwase kala ipu ka Adole ni ya dala ela ni. <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />Ala byuwa kpotu neshi ipu ki imu, ikweyi ko oko ni aba ya ni. Ala bagye ko neshi kpi iyi kala. <verse eid="1TH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />Aba ba ala ayene, ala gba awine ka ayaga mani apwo, ala tawase ni ba yoshi ni otugbagba, ala tawase ni gboshu lo ni abo, ala gbotu mene kpa ananaho.<verse eid="1TH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Ase ni yo bibi ka sanu obibi lo, ala ke yoza neshi kpiyi kala ki kpa ananoho ishi kpiri.<verse eid="1TH 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Ala gbotu shosha ishi kpiri; <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />tinarigwu ishi nye; <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />ala shotunehe ipu kojoji. Oza ni Owuso ya yimu ebe kala ipu ko Okristi Oyesu ni oma.<verse eid="1TH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />Ala ka wo Omaku ko Owuso obi ko yoko lo; <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />ala ka tela koleho ko Owuso lo. <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />Ala mo oza kpiri ma: ala ya abo byo olamu ni wo neshi ni <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />kweyi ala gwowe koza labi wonyonya tagye.<verse eid="1TH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Owuso ni ya daha omene ni, na ya ala wase neshi, kweyi na gbeho kala; ko omaku, ko otu kala kpiri, shini ana ka kwalepwo eno ko wowa ka Adole kaha Oyesu Okristi lo. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Anu ni yala ogwu ni ya kokame lo, oyaya mani.<verse eid="1TH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />Ayene, ala tinarigwu daha. <verse eid="1TH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Ala ta ayene kpiri ogbogba kweyi kwuwa botu kpotu oye kponu. <verse eid="1TH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />Nyya bala ipu koshu ka Adole, ala koza ni yipu ko okpa mani da ayene kpiri. <verse eid="1TH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Nyya beshi ka Adole Oyesu Okristi na yo kpa ala.<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>